    "description": "Draft contract for Omnichannel Inventory and Sales Management System. Proposed paths/DTOs must be reviewed against the approved domain model. / Hợp đồng nháp OISM; cần duyệt theo domain model chính thức."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://localhost:5001/api/v1",
      "description": "Local development placeholder / URL phát triển mẫu"
    }
